<title>UK: SocGen sets call warrants on Pharma Vision.</title>
<headline>SocGen sets call warrants on Pharma Vision.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued five million American-style call warrants on Pharma Vision 2000 AG bearer shares, lead manager Societe Generale Bank and Trust said on Friday.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    525 SFR		   PREMIUM	8.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.90 SFR		  GEARING	7.9 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	17.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS STOCK EXCHANGE  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  547 SFR</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
